#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Boat Position"
msgstr "Båd GPS"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Tracks and displays the boat's GPS position. Receives positions from the boat's router, stores them in the database, and provides a live map and voyage logbook."
msgstr "Sporer og viser bådens GPS-position. Modtager positioner fra bådens router, gemmer dem i databasen og giver et live-kort og en sejllogshistorik."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "PCIO"
msgstr "PCIO"

